{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:58 2026-09-08 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:58 2026-09-08 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:58 2026-09-08 HKT</p><p>今(8日)早上10時57分，灣仔警察總部西翼一辦公室，有碎紙機起火，據稱一名女警臉部燒傷，清醒送往律敦治醫院治理。受傷女警兩前臂被包紮，臉部敷上敷料，清醒送院。</p><img alt=\"女警燒傷臉送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7b584d09f32c2b9276c1f954657cd33/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_21_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女警清醒送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01002a11d8b5cc3e82eaaa76c98c0bbb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_21_35_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女警送院治理。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b4cb526bfdde1878f125c10f7077cf6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_21_01_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5726a962bed32562fbef1626500ed78/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_21_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警察總部有辦公室碎紙機起火。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60f0fb51e774608a440224297903d90b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-08_at_12_21_00.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T05:18:01.261049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}